          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 12:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ufunuo wa neno la BWANA juu ya Israeli. Haya ndiyo asemayo BWANA, azitandaye mbingu, auwekaye msingi wa dunia, aiumbaye roho ya mwanadamu ndani yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angalia, mimi nitafanya Yerusalemu kuwa kikombe cha kuyumba-yumba kwa watu wa kabila zote, wazungukao pande zote; tena kitakuwa juu ya Yuda pia wakati wa kuhusuriwa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 21:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena itakuwa siku hiyo, nitafanya Yerusalemu kuwa jiwe la kuwalemea watu wa kabila zote; wote watakaojitwika jiwe hilo watapata jeraha nyingi; na mataifa yote ya dunia watakusanyika pamoja juu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.76.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 76:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika siku hiyo, asema BWANA, nitamtia kila farasi ushangao, na yeye ampandaye nitamtia wazimu; nami nitaifunulia nyumba ya Yuda macho yangu, nami nitamtia upofu kila farasi wa hizo kabila za watu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakuu wa Yuda watasema mioyoni mwao, Wenyeji wa Yerusalemu ni nguvu zangu katika BWANA wa majeshi, Mungu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo nitawafanya wakuu wa Yuda kuwa kama kigae chenye moto katika kuni, na kama kinga cha moto katika miganda; nao watateketeza watu wa kila kabila, wawazungukao pande zote, upande wa mkono wa kuume na upande wa mkono wa kushoto; na baada ya haya Yerusalemu utakaa mahali pake, naam, hapo Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.27+1CO.1.28+1CO.1.29+1CO.1.30+1CO.1.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 1:27-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye BWANA ataziokoa hema za Yuda kwanza, ili utukufu wa nyumba ya Daudi, na utukufu wa wenyeji wa Yerusalemu, usipate kutukuzwa kuliko Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika siku hiyo BWANA atawalinda wenyeji wa Yerusalemu; na yeye aliye dhaifu miongoni mwao atakuwa kama Daudi siku hiyo; nayo nyumba ya Daudi itakuwa kama Mungu, kama malaika wa BWANA mbele yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata itakuwa siku hiyo, ya kwamba nitatafuta kuwaangamiza mataifa yote watakaokuja kupigana na Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
